{"title":"A Court Magician","synopsis":"Party ini tidak butuh penyihir tidak cakap yang bisanya cuma menggunakan sihir pendukung\nkau dipecat alec huguette tibatiba alec seorang penyihir istana yang menjadi anggota party pangeran untuk membantu beliau menaklukan dungeon dikeluarkan dari party\ntidak cuma dari party penindasan pangeran pun berlanjut dengan mengusirnya dari istana tapi teman dari akademi sihir mengundang alec\nyang sudah mulai kehilangan kesabaran hei alec apa kau mau mencoba menaklukan dungeon lagi bersama kami\nlalu bersama dengan temanteman satu partynya dimulailah jalan hidup kedua alec\nini adalah cerita tentang mantan penyihir kerajaan yang dikhianati\nempat tahun yang lalu lasting period party beranggotakan empat orang yang dijuluki legenda perlahan mampu mengaungkan namanya ke seluruh penjuru dunia","alternative_title":"A Court Magician, Who Was Focused On Supportive Magic Because His Allies Were Too Weak","author":"Alto","artist":"Yuki Monji","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Magic","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"664dbf93-a328-4cac-9f1b-12ce04c1939e","number":"207","title":"Chapter 207","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"5446cedf-a4c2-42f2-9695-b5a40b1de2f6","number":"206","title":"Chapter 206","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"ad5993b3-4de9-4890-ab2c-ec9cf5f09f3b","number":"205","title":"Chapter 205","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"bb0c7472-32ed-4429-a559-695ccbeb244d","number":"204","title":"Chapter 204","date":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"id":"a00e1336-19e3-43c5-9540-33f24c8257c3","number":"203","title":"Chapter 203","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"b67eaa7e-c99e-42b0-a273-f2030a61e0ab","number":"202","title":"Chapter 202","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"b2bb52bf-cb68-4087-9830-6d4651467ad8","number":"201","title":"Chapter 201","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"56d7dc90-35b3-452e-a4c2-8e44363e7849","number":"200","title":"Chapter 200","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"id":"75735785-8e16-40e7-bd2b-1476849f